        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This massive steel shield (Hardness 8, HP 32, BT 16) is engraved with the image of a roaring face of a bear and lined with patches of bear fur. When you have this shield raised, if any effect would force you to move 10 feet or more, you're moved 5 fewer feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Feral Roar</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You use the shield of the bear to Shield Block a melee Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The attacking creature must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:26] save or be pushed up to 10 feet away from you (15 feet on a critical failure).</p>"
